{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Contact {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — holistic, integrative options for everyday wellness." />
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#fbfbfa; --ink:#1f2933; --muted:#6b7280; --accent:#6a8f6d; --glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
      --card:#ffffff; --shadow: 0 6px 22px rgba(31,41,51,0.06);
      font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial;
    }
    html,body{height:100%;}
    body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;line-height:1.45;}
    /* subtle patterned backdrop (external file expected at assets/img/pattern.svg) */
    .page-wrap{
      min-height:100vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;background-image: url('assets/img/pattern.svg');background-repeat:repeat;background-size:240px 240px;}
    header{padding:28px 24px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;}
    .brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .logo{width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--accent),#7fb889);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-weight:700;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
    nav a{color:var(--ink);text-decoration:none;margin-left:18px;font-weight:600;font-size:0.95rem}
    nav a.small{font-weight:500;color:var(--muted);font-size:0.88rem}

    main{max-width:980px;margin:24px auto;padding:28px;}
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:28px;align-items:start}

    .card{background:var(--card);border-radius:12px;padding:22px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
    h1{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:1.6rem}
    p.lead{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 14px}

    .contact-info{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:0.95rem}

    form{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
    input[type="text"],input[type="email"],select,textarea{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e6e9ec;background:transparent}
    textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}
    .row{display:flex;gap:10px}
    .btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:8px;border:0;background:var(--accent);color:white;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}
    .secondary{background:#eef6ef;color:var(--accent);border:1px solid rgba(106,143,109,0.12)}

    .meta{font-size:0.88rem;color:var(--muted)}

    /* Try-it modal */
    .overlay{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(12,17,13,0.45);display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:20px;z-index:1200}
    .overlay.active{display:flex}
    .modal{width:100%;max-width:720px;border-radius:14px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.98),white);padding:20px;box-shadow:0 18px 50px rgba(10,12,10,0.25)}
    .modal h3{margin-top:0}
    .exercise-stage{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:18px}
    .pulse{width:120px;height:120px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#e8f6ec,#cfe8d6);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
    .hidden{display:none}

    /* reveal */
    .reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(14px);transition:opacity 480ms ease,transform 540ms ease}
    .reveal.visible{opacity:1;transform:none}
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
      .reveal{transition:none;transform:none;opacity:1}
    }

    footer{padding:18px 24px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:0.9rem}

    /* responsive */
    @media (max-width:880px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.brand{gap:8px}.logo{width:40px;height:40px}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="page-wrap">
    <header>
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="logo">H</div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
          <div style="font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--muted)">Holistic & integrative guidance in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav aria-label="Primary">
        <a href="index.html">Home</a>
        <a href="about.html">Who We Are</a>
        <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
        <a href="approach.html">Approach</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Investment</a>
        <a href="book.html" class="small">Begin</a>
        <a href="contact.html" class="small">Connect</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="card reveal" id="intro">
        <h1>Reach out. Let curiosity lead.</h1>
        <p class="lead">If you have questions about options, next steps, or how gentle practices might sit in your day, we welcome your note. No pressure — an open conversation first helps us map an appropriate path.</p>
        <div class="row" style="margin-top:12px">
          <button class="btn" id="openExercise">Try a guided practice</button>
          <a href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}" class="btn secondary" style="text-decoration:none" aria-label="Primary action">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="grid">
        <aside class="card reveal" id="contactPanel">
          <h2 style="margin-top:0">Contact details</h2>
          <div class="contact-info">
            <div class="muted">Phone</div>
            <div><a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
            <div class="muted">Email</div>
            <div><a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
            <div class="muted">Location</div>
            <div>{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
            <div class="muted">Hours</div>
            <div class="meta">Mon–Fri by appointment / occasional weekend openings</div>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-top:16px">
            <p class="muted">Prefer to book directly? Click Begin in the top menu or use the primary action above.</p>
          </div>
        </aside>

        <section class="card reveal" id="formCard">
          <h2>Send a note</h2>
          <p class="meta">A short message helps us prepare a thoughtful reply. We aim to respond within 2 business days.</p>
          <form id="contactForm" novalidate>
            <div class="row">
              <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Your name" required aria-label="Name">
              <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Email" required aria-label="Email">
            </div>
            <div class="row">
              <input type="text" name="phone" placeholder="Phone (optional)" aria-label="Phone">
              <select name="interest" aria-label="Area of interest">
                <option value="">I'm interested in...</option>
                <option value="consult">Initial consultation</option>
                <option value="program">Ongoing support</option>
                <option value="session">Single session</option>
                <option value="other">Other/question</option>
              </select>
            </div>
            <textarea name="message" placeholder="Tell us briefly what brings you here..." aria-label="Message"></textarea>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin-top:6px">
              <button type="submit" class="btn">Send message</button>
              <button type="button" id="clear" class="btn secondary">Clear</button>
            </div>
            <div id="formStatus" class="meta" style="margin-top:10px"></div>
          </form>
        </section>
      </div>

      <section class="card reveal" id="faq" style="margin-top:22px">
        <h2>Quick questions</h2>
        <div style="display:grid;gap:12px;margin-top:8px">
          <div>
            <strong>Do you offer remote visits?</strong>
            <div class="muted">Yes. Telehealth options are available for many consultations and follow-ups.</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <strong>Will you replace my existing care?</strong>
            <div class="muted">No. We work alongside your current providers with respect and coordination when appropriate.</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <strong>Is payment required to ask a question?</strong>
            <div class="muted">No. Introductory questions and scheduling inquiries are complimentary.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

    </main>

    <footer>
      <div class="meta">Questions? Call <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> or <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a>. For appointments begin at <a href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>.</div>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <!-- Guided exercise modal -->
  <div class="overlay" id="overlay" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal" role="document">
      <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
        <h3 id="exerciseTitle">Guided Mini-Practice</h3>
        <button id="closeExercise" aria-label="Close" class="secondary" style="border-radius:8px;padding:8px">Close</button>
      </div>
      <p class="muted">A brief, optional practice to notice breath and intention. Safe for most people; if any movement or breath-focused work feels uncomfortable, stop and rest.</p>

      <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px">
        <button class="btn" data-type="breath">Breathing (2 min)</button>
        <button class="btn" data-type="journal">Journaling (5 min)</button>
        <button class="btn" data-type="intention">Set an Intention (1 min)</button>
      </div>

      <div id="exercise" style="margin-top:16px">
        <div class="exercise-stage hidden" id="stageSetup">
          <div class="pulse" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <div id="stageText">Choose a practice to begin.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="exercise-stage hidden" id="stageRunning">
          <div class="pulse" id="pulseVisual" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <div id="timerText" style="font-weight:700;font-size:1.1rem">Ready</div>
          <div class="muted" id="guidance">Follow along with gentle prompts.</div>
          <div style="margin-top:8px">
            <button id="stopExercise" class="btn secondary">Stop</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="exercise-stage hidden" id="stageDone">
          <div style="font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:700">Well done</div>
          <div class="muted">Take a moment to notice how you feel.</div>
          <div style="margin-top:8px"><button id="closeDone" class="btn">Close</button></div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    // Accessible reveal on scroll
    (function(){
      const prefersReduced = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
      if(prefersReduced){
        document.querySelectorAll('.reveal').forEach(el=>el.classList.add('visible'));
        return;
      }
      const io = new IntersectionObserver((entries)=>{
        entries.forEach(entry=>{
          if(entry.isIntersecting){
            entry.target.classList.add('visible');
            io.unobserve(entry.target);
          }
        });
      },{threshold:0.12});
      document.querySelectorAll('.reveal').forEach(el=>io.observe(el));
    })();

    // Contact form handling (client-only)
    (function(){
      const form = document.getElementById('contactForm');
      const status = document.getElementById('formStatus');
      const clear = document.getElementById('clear');
      form.addEventListener('submit', function(e){
        e.preventDefault();
        const data = new FormData(form);
        if(!data.get('name') || !data.get('email')){
          status.textContent = 'Please include your name and an email.';
          status.style.color = '#c44';
          return;
        }
        // fake send
        status.textContent = 'Sending...';
        status.style.color = 'var(--muted)';
        setTimeout(()=>{
          status.textContent = 'Thanks — we received your message and will reply within 2 business days.';
          status.style.color = 'var(--accent)';
          form.reset();
        },800);
      });
      clear.addEventListener('click', ()=>{form.reset();status.textContent='';});
    })();

    // Guided exercise logic
    (function(){
      const overlay = document.getElementById('overlay');
      const open = document.getElementById('openExercise');
      const close = document.getElementById('closeExercise');
      const stop = document.getElementById('stopExercise');
      const closeDone = document.getElementById('closeDone');
      const choices = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('[data-type]'));
      const stageSetup = document.getElementById('stageSetup');
      const stageRunning = document.getElementById('stageRunning');
      const stageDone = document.getElementById('stageDone');
      const stageText = document.getElementById('stageText');
      const timerText = document.getElementById('timerText');
      const guidance = document.getElementById('guidance');
      const pulse = document.getElementById('pulseVisual');

      let timer = null; let timeLeft=0; let stepIndex=0; let mode='';

      function showOverlay(){ overlay.classList.add('active'); overlay.setAttribute('aria-hidden','false'); stageSetup.classList.remove('hidden'); stageRunning.classList.add('hidden'); stageDone.classList.add('hidden'); stageText.textContent='Choose a practice to begin.'; }
      function hideOverlay(){ overlay.classList.remove('active'); overlay.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true'); stopRunning(); }

      open.addEventListener('click', showOverlay);
      close.addEventListener('click', hideOverlay);
      closeDone.addEventListener('click', hideOverlay);

      choices.forEach(btn=>{
        btn.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
          mode = btn.getAttribute('data-type');
          startMode(mode);
        });
      });

      function prefersReduced(){return window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;}

      function startMode(t){
        stageSetup.classList.add('hidden');
        stageRunning.classList.remove('hidden');
        stageDone.classList.add('hidden');

        if(t==='breath'){
          timeLeft = 120; // seconds
          stepIndex = 0;
          runBreath();
        } else if(t==='journal'){
          timeLeft = 300; // seconds
          guidance.textContent = 'Write freely. If helpful, try the prompt: "Today I notice..."';
          timerLoop();
        } else if(t==='intention'){
          timeLeft = 60;
          guidance.textContent = 'Close your eyes for a moment and name one simple intention for your next hour.';
          timerLoop();
        }
      }

      function runBreath(){
        if(prefersReduced()){
          guidance.textContent = 'Follow a calm inhale and exhale at your comfortable pace for about 2 minutes.';
          timerLoop();
          return;
        }
        // sequence beats: inhale 4s, hold 2s, exhale 6s (approx)
        const cycle = [{label:'Inhale',t:4},{label:'Hold',t:2},{label:'Exhale',t:6}];
        let cycleIndex = 0;
        const start = Date.now();
        function beat(){
          if(timeLeft<=0){endExercise();return;}
          const cur = cycle[cycleIndex];
          guidance.textContent = cur.label + ' — follow the breath.';
          animatePulse(cur.t*1000);
          let localTimer = cur.t;
          const tick = ()=>{
            if(timeLeft<=0){endExercise();return;}
            timerText.textContent = `${Math.max(0,timeLeft)}s`;
            localTimer -=1; timeLeft -=1;
            if(localTimer<=0){
              cycleIndex = (cycleIndex+1)%cycle.length;
              setTimeout(beat, 0);
            } else {
              timer = setTimeout(tick,1000);
            }
          };
          tick();
        }
        beat();
      }

      function animatePulse(ms){
        if(prefersReduced()) return; // no motion
        pulse.animate([
          {transform:'scale(0.9)',opacity:0.9},
          {transform:'scale(1.12)',opacity:1},
          {transform:'scale(0.9)',opacity:0.9}
        ],{duration:ms,iterations:1,easing:'ease-in-out'});
      }

      function timerLoop(){
        timerText.textContent = `${timeLeft}s`;
        if(timeLeft<=0){ endExercise(); return; }
        timer = setTimeout(()=>{ timeLeft-=1; timerLoop(); },1000);
      }

      function stopRunning(){ if(timer){ clearTimeout(timer); timer=null; } }

      function endExercise(){ stopRunning(); stageRunning.classList.add('hidden'); stageDone.classList.remove('hidden'); }

      stop.addEventListener('click', ()=>{ endExercise(); });

      // close with escape
      window.addEventListener('keydown', function(e){ if(e.key==='Escape'){ if(overlay.classList.contains('active')) hideOverlay(); } });

      // trap focus minimally
      overlay.addEventListener('click', (e)=>{ if(e.target===overlay) hideOverlay(); });
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Contact page and instructions for chunk 4

Files included in this bundle:
- contact.html : the full contact page with a contact form, contact details, quick FAQ, and a guided practice modal (breathing / journaling / intention).

Purpose and how to use:
- Place contact.html at the root of your site alongside the other pages (index.html, about.html, etc.).
- The page expects a site-level SVG used as a repeating background at assets/img/pattern.svg. The path is referenced from CSS: url('assets/img/pattern.svg'). Create a unique pattern SVG at that path to match the project style.

Placeholders to replace (left literal in the HTML):
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}} (optional elsewhere)
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}

Accessibility and progressive enhancement notes:
- Scroll reveals use IntersectionObserver to add the .visible class. If the user prefers reduced motion (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce), elements are shown immediately with no transitions.
- The guided exercise modal respects prefers-reduced-motion and will not run motion animations when the preference is set.
- The modal is dismissible via the Close button, the overlay background, and the Escape key.
- Form submits are intercepted client-side for a demo flow; production should POST to your server endpoint or integrate with an email/CRM service.

Guided exercise behavior:
- Three practice types: breathing (2 minutes), journaling (5 minutes), and short intention setting (1 minute).
- Breathing uses a simple inhale/hold/exhale loop; if prefers-reduced-motion is true, it will fall back to non-animated guidance.
- Timer is client-side only and ends the session with a brief acknowledgement. No data is recorded by the exercise.

Developer notes:
- No external fonts, CDNs, or images are included in this chunk. Keep assets local.
- The contact form is intentionally lightweight and client-side to illustrate flow; replace with real submission logic on your server.
- Nav labels intentionally differ from common templates: Home / Who We Are / Offerings / Approach / Investment / Begin / Connect.

If you need the companion assets (SVG pattern) or other pages in the site, request the next chunk and specify which asset you want next."}
BUNDLE_END
